spannend macht: Das dezent herbe Aroma in Verbindung mit der\u00a0<strong>beerigen Note </strong>und <strong>S\u00fc\u00dfe </strong>der Orangen.<br/><br/>Wenn du noch mehr <a href=\"https://odonnell.de/\" title=\"Hochwertiger Lik\u00f6r von O'Donnell Moonshine\">hochwertigen Lik\u00f6r</a> entdecken m\u00f6chtest, wirf einfach einen Blick auf unsere anderen vielf\u00e4ltigen\u00a0<strong>Moonshine-Sorten</strong>\u00a0und werde Teil der <a href=\"/pages/gang\" title=\"Die O'Donnell Gang\">Moonshine-Gang</a>.</p>","page":""}},"collapsible-row-3":{"type":"collapsible_tab","settings":{"heading":"Cocktailvorschlag","icon":"bottle","content":"<h3>Blutorange Spritz</h3><h4>Zutaten:</h4><ul><li>40ml Blutorange</li><li>40ml Prosecco</li><li>20ml Blutorangensaft</li><li>60ml Mineralwasser</li><li>Eisw\u00fcrfel</li></ul><h4>Zubereitung:</h4><ol><li>Eisw\u00fcrfel und Blutorange in ein Glas geben</li><li>Prosecco\u00a0hinzuf\u00fcgen</li><li>Saft hinzuf\u00fcgen</li><li>Mit Mineralwasser auff\u00fcllen</li></ol><p><br/>Mehr Rezepte findest du in unserem <a href=\"/blogs/cocktails\" title=\"Cocktails\">Cocktails-Blog</a>.</p>","page":""}},"collapsible-row-1":{"type":"collapsible_tab","settings":{"heading":"Komm in die O'Donnell Gang","icon":"silhouette","content":"<p>Werde Teil der <a href=\"/pages/gang\" title=\"Die O'Donnell Gang\">Moonshine-Gang</a>! Als Mitglied sammelst du mit jedem Kauf im Onlineshop Proof und kannst diese gegen gratis O\u2019Donnell Geschenke eintauschen. Au\u00dferdem hast du Zugang zu exklusiven Produkten und kannst im Gang-Rang immer weiter aufsteigen. Worauf wartest du also noch?\u00a0Wir schmuggeln dir den Schnaps direkt nach Hause \u2014 v\u00f6llig legal nat\u00fcrlich!</p>","page":""}},"collapsible-row-0":{"type":"collapsible_tab","settings":{"heading":"Versand","icon":"truck","content":"<ul><li><strong>DHL Priority: Lieferzeit 1-2 Werktage</strong></li></ul><p>Alle Bestellungen bis 12 Uhr werden noch am selben Tag DHL \u00fcbergeben.</p><ul><li><strong>DHL Standard: Lieferzeit 2-3 Werktage</strong></li></ul>","page":""}},"delivery_badge_default":{"type":"delivery_badge","settings":{"delivery_text":"Delivery 1-2"}}},"block_order":["title","caption","e028111e-b42b-4efb-94ee-c750e98e4fb2","price","delivery_badge_default","variant_picker","da8ef1d6-d5ee-4fd6-a726-7c6359134946","quantity_selector","buy_buttons","wishlist_engine_product_page_yGNKXA","description","recommended_products_mqcCPK","collapsible-row-2","collapsible-row-3","collapsible-row-1","collapsible-row-0"],"settings":{"gift_card_receipient_enabled":false,"is_above_the_fold":true,"enable_sticky_info":true,"badges_enabled":false,"gallery_layout":"thumbnail","media_size":"medium","mobile_thumbnails":"hide","hide_variants":true,"enable_video_looping":false,"padding_top":24,"padding_bottom":12}},"image-with-text":{"type":"image-with-text","blocks":{"image-with-text-0":{"type":"heading","settings":{"heading":"\"Bloody\" Rabatt f\u00fcr die Halloween-Saison!","heading_size":"h2"}},"image-with-text-1":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>Nur f\u00fcr kurze Zeit! Wende den Rabattcode \"Bloody\" im Checkout an und erhalten 15% Rabatt auf unsere gruselige <em>Blutorange! </em>Sichere dir jetzt die perfekte Sorte f\u00fcr die Halloween-Party!</p>","text_style":"body"}}},"block_order":["image-with-text-0","image-with-text-1"],"disabled":true,"settings":{"is_above_the_fold":false,"background_color":"#ffffff","text_color":"#000000","image":"shopify://shop_images/Blutorange_Discount.jpg","image_caption":"","height":"adapt","desktop_image_width":"medium","layout":"image_first","desktop_content_position":"middle","desktop_content_alignment":"left","content_layout":"overlap","color_scheme":"background-2","mobile_content_alignment":"left","padding_top":24,"padding_bottom":12}},"908f5a7a-2f83-4950-b076-8e10aebcf4bc":{"type":"image-with-text","blocks":{"template--17965385908492__908f5a7a-2f83-4950-b076-8e10aebcf4bc-1685537507d81d2041-0":{"type":"heading","settings":{"heading":"Blutorange - Passt immer und \u00fcberall","heading_size":"h2"}},"template--17965385908492__908f5a7a-2f83-4950-b076-8e10aebcf4bc-1685537507d81d2041-1":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>Was darf im Sommer nicht fehlen? Ein fruchtiger Lik\u00f6r, der zu jeder Gelegenheit passt. Egal ob Zuhause oder Unterwegs, <em>Blutorange </em>versorgt euch mit einem erfrischenden Geschmack, ob pur oder als Cocktail.</p>","text_style":"body"}}},"block_order":["template--17965385908492__908f5a7a-2f83-4950-b076-8e10aebcf4bc-1685537507d81d2041-0","template--17965385908492__908f5a7a-2f83-4950-b076-8e10aebcf4bc-1685537507d81d2041-1"],"settings":{"is_above_the_fold":false,"background_color":"#ffffff","text_color":"#000000","image":"shopify://shop_images/Blutorange_Mood2_1.jpg","image_caption":"","height":"adapt","desktop_image_width":"medium","layout":"text_first","desktop_content_position":"middle","desktop_content_alignment":"left","content_layout":"overlap","color_scheme":"background-2","mobile_content_alignment":"left","padding_top":12,"padding_bottom":12}},"1ffdec01-4f71-4c62-99a3-677e32026747":{"type":"image-with-text","blocks":{"template--17965385908492__1ffdec01-4f71-4c62-99a3-677e32026747-1685537507d81d2041-0":{"type":"heading","settings":{"heading":"Cocktails und Longdrinks","heading_size":"h2"}},"template--17965385908492__1ffdec01-4f71-4c62-99a3-677e32026747-1685537507d81d2041-1":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>Nat\u00fcrlich kann man unseren Moonshine nicht nur pur trinken, sondern auch in leckere Cocktails oder Longdrinks verarbeiten. Gerne kannst du selbst experimentieren und herausfinden, in welchen Mischungen dir die <em>Blutorange</em> am besten schmeckt, aber solltest du Inspiration suchen, schau doch in unserem Cocktails-Blog vorbei!</p>","text_style":"body"}},"template--17965385908492__1ffdec01-4f71-4c62-99a3-677e32026747-1685537507d81d2041-2":{"type":"button","settings":{"button_label":"Zum Cocktails-Blog","button_link":"shopify://blogs/cocktail